      "text": "Beware of false prophets, which come to you in sheep’s clothing, Matt. 7:15 (3 Ne. 14:15). many false prophets shall rise, and shall deceive many, Matt. 24:11 (JS—M 1:9). there shall arise false Christs, and false prophets, Matt. 24:24 (Mark 13:22; JS—M 1:22). such are false apostles, deceitful workers, 2 Cor. 11:13. They profess that they know God; but in works they deny him, Titus 1:16. false prophets also among the people, 2 Pet. 2:1. many false prophets are gone out into the world, 1 Jn. 4:1. out of the mouth of the false prophet, Rev. 16:13. beast … with him the false prophet that wrought miracles, Rev. 19:20.",
